  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - 1.\tThe proposed single storey rear extension; by reason of its size, would result in overdevelopment of the site. The elimination of on-site car parking would put undue pressure on the parking stock of the surrounding area, the proposed refuse storage would be harmful to the appearance of the area and to neighbours' living conditions through pollution and loss of outlook  and the repositioning of the external stairwell of the first floor residential dwelling would create a potentially dangerous situation for the occupants. The proposal is contrary to Policies ENV B.1.1; H.6.4; S.4.7 and T.4.6 of the Unitary Development Plan and Guideline 3 of the Council's Supplementary Planning Guidance."
